  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi Policing Improvement Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Malawi Police Service with &#xa3;3m with the aim of improving the public&apos;s satisfaction of police responsiveness and accountability. The overall outcome will be a Malawi Police Service that is better able to deal with public order issues while protecting constitutional rights and enforcing internal accountability of officers.</narrative>
  </description>
